.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-TYPECHECK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-typecheck
.Nd validate RBS signatures and run Zdots seam contract specs
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -coverage
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
validates the RBS type signatures under
.Pa sig/
using
.Ql rbs -I sig validate
and executes the Zdots seam contract test suite under
.Ql rbs/test/setup
runtime instrumentation.
No database or background services are required.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--coverage"
.It Fl -coverage
Report how many of the classes and modules defined in
.Pa lib/
are declared in
.Pa sig/ .
The first line is
.Ql rbs coverage: N/M (P%) ;
each class or module without a signature follows as
.Ql missing: Name .
.Ic make typecheck
and
.Pa tests/typecheck.bats
fail when the percentage drops below the floor in
.Pa docs/generated/rbs-coverage-baseline.txt .
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage and exit.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr check 1 ,
.Xr zdots-doctor 1
